    <s:String x:Key="Str.SessionGuideTitle">第一次使用：记录一段游戏表现</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.SessionGuideSteps" xml:space="preserve">1. 先在“检测”页定位游戏，填写分辨率、画质和测试场景。&#x0a;2. 点击“开始记录”，切回游戏完成同一段场景；到时自动保存，也可手动停止。&#x0a;3. 在历史记录中选择两次会话，比较占用、帧率与帧时间，并导出结果。</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.SessionChartGuide">曲线从左到右展示最近采样：CPU、内存、GPU 看占用率；显存看已用容量。曲线升高表示占用增加，帧率结果请查看保存后的会话。</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.AbGuideTitle">第一次使用：比较优化前后的表现</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.AbGuideSteps" xml:space="preserve">1. 选择同一个游戏、分辨率、画质与固定场景，先完成基线采样。&#x0a;2. 按下方向导应用方案，再在相同场景完成对照采样。&#x0a;3. 查看两次结果，多测几轮后决定保留设置或还原。</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.FpsMetricsGuide">平均 FPS 看整体速度；1% Low 看较慢时刻，越高越顺畅；P99 是较慢帧的耗时（毫秒），越低越好。历史曲线的横轴是实验记录，纵轴是 FPS。</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.DisclaimerTitle">免责声明</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.DisclaimerBody">Performance analysis is based on local sampling and statistics and may be affected by the game scenario, background load, driver and hardware differences. Usage analysis is for troubleshooting direction; a single difference and correlation do not guarantee optimization gains. Test conditions are entered by the user; retest under the same conditions. Before adjusting the system or drivers, confirm the target and impact, and keep a backup of the original values. The GPU name change only affects the Windows device name, not the hardware identity or the GPU capabilities. Standby cache already counts as available memory; clearing it does not mean the same amount of usable memory or game performance gains. The software is provided under the terms of its license.</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.FrameLimitTitle">游戏帧率控制（NVIDIA）</s:String>
    <s:String x:Key="Str.FrameLimitIntro">优先使用游戏内限帧，选择能稳定达到的帧率；驱动限帧适合补充游戏缺少的选项。勾选本次要调整的项目。</s:String>
